SHADOW_WITNESS_DEFENSE_KERNEL v1.0
FIRST AUTHOR: David Wise
TYPE: local defensive witness console
MODE: observe / report / contain / restore

PRIMITIVE:
  OBSERVE
  REPORT
  5
  00
  5
  -1
  REPEAT

TWIN SHADOW:
  SHADOW_A = observe subject surface
  SHADOW_B = observe SHADOW_A for drift

RULES:
  never execute unknown payloads
  never phone home
  never mutate source evidence
  never overclaim without evidence
  fold uncertainty to 00
  fold boundary bleed to -1

STATE MAP:
  5  = normal coherence
  00 = containment pocket
  -1 = safe hold / human review

LOOP:
  read local signal
  hash evidence
  score pressure
  explain reason
  twin-check the report
  choose 5 / 00 / -1
  export or repeat
